00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.500
So I'm not the star of this
show, though, honestly.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.570
I'm joined here by Subra,
from The Home Depot.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:23.473
And if you're going to
listen to any of it,

00:00:23.473 --> 00:00:25.140
listen to what he's
saying, because he's

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.630
going to talk about data
